# Reviewed vulnerability baseline for the container images built in CI.
#
# The image scan gate blocks HIGH and CRITICAL findings. Entries below are
# accepted risks that come from the upstream base images
# (mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspnet:10.0 and nginx:1.27-alpine); they are not
# reachable through a dependency this repository can patch.
#
# Rules for editing this file:
#   * only list findings that have a fix available (CI scans with
#     --ignore-unfixed, so unfixed findings never block);
#   * re-review at least quarterly and whenever a base image is bumped: drop a
#     line as soon as the base image ships the fixed package;
#   * never add an entry for a package the application itself pulls in - fix or
#     upgrade it instead;
#   * the base images here are past their vendor support window, so this list
#     must shrink, not grow (see docs/guide/operations/security-checklist.md).
#
# Regenerate the candidate list with:
#   trivy image --scanners vuln --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed \
#     --format json -o /tmp/scan.json <image>
